        "widgetData": {
          "content": "<p>Eoghan O'Connell has been voted by County supporters as October's Christophe Duchamp Player of the Month winner, with the defender continuing to play a key role in the Hatters' promotion push.</p>\n<p>The Irishman has quickly become an integral part of County's back-line since joining on a free transfer from Barnsley in the summer, starting all 14 of our league games this season under former teammate Jimmy McNulty.</p>\n<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">Eoghan featured six times at the heart of County's back three during October and has flourished in a system that utilises his exceptional ball-playing abilities, with the defender often helping to initiate County's attacks from the back.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
          "contentDouble": null,
          "imageKey": null,
          "mediaLibraryID": null,
          "toggleDouble": null
        },
