    },
    {
      "rowData": {
        "widgetData": {
          "content": "<p>He helped County to four wins from those six games last month, keeping two clean sheets in the process, as the Hatters moved into the automatic promotion places heading into November.</p>\n<p>It was also Eoghan's ball out from the back that led to Adama Sidibeh's crucial equaliser against Notts County at Meadow Lane, underlining the centre-half's contribution at both ends of the pitch.</p>\n<p>New for this season, Player of the Month sponsor Christophe Duchamp will be providing a new watch to each of our winners, with Eoghan presented with this month's award after seeing off close competition from September's winner, Kyle Wootton.</p>",
